  {
   "id": "mechthild",
   "name": "Mechthild Ambrosius",
   "title": "Poor Scholar of the Collegium",
   "hint": "an ink-stained woman asleep on a pile of books",
   "meet": "The ink-stained woman wakes, looks at what you are reading, and corrects your Allorese. “Mechthild. I’m writing a history of everything. Sit down, you’re in my light.”",
   "talk": [
    "Mechthild has found a contradiction in the Collegium’s founding charter and is beside herself with joy.",
    "“Nobody reads anymore,” Mechthild sighs, surrounded by four hundred people reading."
   ],
