  {
   "id": "zanetta",
   "name": "Zanetta Bon",
   "title": "Gondolier of Marre",
   "hint": "a gondolier singing as she rows",
   "meet": "The gondolier rests her oar. “You row like a Luggish barge, but you’re learning. Zanetta. Get in, I’ll show you the canals nobody shows foreigners.”",
   "talk": [
    "Zanetta knows which palazzi have secret water-gates, and which families use them for what.",
    "“Every gondolier in Marre is a spy for somebody,” Zanetta says. “I’m a spy for me.”"
   ],
