  {
   "id": "bastian",
   "name": "Bastian Caro",
   "title": "Silverer’s Apprentice of the Glass Isles",
   "hint": "a pale apprentice with silver on his fingertips",
   "meet": "The apprentice catches your reflection in a half-silvered glass and smiles at it, not at you. “You have a good reflection. I’m Bastian. Don’t tell the masters I spoke to you.”",
   "talk": [
    "Bastian swears the Masque mirrors are just very good glass. He swears it a little too quickly.",
    "“The Republic won’t let silverers leave the Isles,” Bastian says. “I’ve never wanted to. Mostly.”"
   ],
