   "name": "Momolo Scarpa",
   "title": "Smuggler of Selino",
   "hint": "a lean man in a sailor’s cap who never sits with his back to the door",
   "meet": "The lean man slides onto the bench beside you. “The Cerdans have your description. That makes you interesting. Momolo. I know a boat.”",
   "talk": [
    "Momolo knows every channel in the lagoon the customs boats can’t follow.",
    "“Smuggling’s an honest trade,” Momolo says. “It’s the customs that’s the theft.”"
