   "name": "Cateruccia Vio",
   "title": "Nurse of the Lazaretto",
   "hint": "a brisk nurse smelling of vinegar and juniper",
   "meet": "The nurse pushes a cup of vinegar-water at you. “Drink. You’ve been on the wards a week and you’re not dead, so you’re either lucky or careful. I’m Cateruccia. Be careful.”",
   "talk": [
    "Cateruccia has nursed through three Pestilences and has a theory about each of them.",
    "“The Prior says it’s seeds too small to see,” Cateruccia says. “I say it’s dirt. We both say wash your hands.”"
